# std/rgrep's image (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): build this directory as a
# Rust project with /std/rustc. `--src:@=.` hands rustc this whole tree (its
# Cargo.toml + src/); `--runner:@=/std/runner` is the base its `finish` curries
# the built binary onto. rustc already carries its `--cargo` (the seeded
# /std/cargo image) and `--worker-common` bound in, so nothing else is needed.
# The result is curry(runner, worker1=<the compiled binary>) — a ready-to-run
# worker in the shared runner pool.
run /std/rustc -- --src:@=. --runner:@=/std/runner
